/// M09 CORE-031 "bundled native declarations: roots green, five assert roots".
/// Source: tests/integration/native_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledNativeDeclarations (L15-87).
/// Related fixture: compiler/testdata/current/native/declarations.can (read
/// at L63, staged pristine as src/main.can at L67; the six bad sources at
/// L73-80 apply to later legs only, never the green baseline; the 8 native
/// raw fixtures stage at L68).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): static green-baseline inventory of the staged
/// declarations project: build-green with a passing report carrying exactly
/// 5 roots, grounded per declaration in declarations.can (question 0,
/// assess 1, weighted 0, arms 0, variadic_weighted 0, describe 1, generate
/// 1, retrieve 1, main 1).
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): the Go test runs canlc build,
/// not canlc assert (L69: run("build"); L70: status 0 and empty diagnostics
/// or the test fatals "native frontend"), so no assert report exists to
/// observe; assert-green/report-passed record the static green baseline for
/// P23 qualification, and root-count plus the per-declaration *-roots pins
/// record the assert inventory the fixture would report (per the CORE-014
/// seal_size precedent and declaration.Assertions roots: asks branches and
/// plain records without asserts blocks contribute 0, matching the CORE-022
/// select and CORE-029 likelihood precedents). No execution is claimed here
/// (accept_after P23 unmet).
/// Facet map (native_test.go legs plus fixture arms): assert-green pins the
/// green baseline (L69-72: build exit 0 with empty diagnostics);
/// report-passed pins the passing report on the pristine fixture;
/// root-count pins the five roots (fixture asserts blocks: assess L35-36,
/// describe L64, generate L72-73, retrieve L79-80, main L90);
/// fixture-name grounds the pins in the staged path (L63: declarations.can
/// source; L67: src/main.can); question-roots pins question (fixture L20-28:
/// asks branches only, no asserts block, 0 roots); assess-roots pins assess
/// (fixture L30-39: defaults with the raw declarations_assess.json fixture,
/// 1 root); weights-roots pins weighted (fixture L41-46: asks branches
/// only, no asserts block, 0 roots); arms-roots pins arms (fixture L48-50:
/// plain record, no asserts block, 0 roots); variadic-roots pins
/// variadic_weighted (fixture L52-57: asks branches only, no asserts block,
/// 0 roots); describe-roots pins describe (fixture L59-65: sample, 1 root);
/// generate-roots pins generate (fixture L67-74: drafted with the raw
/// declarations_generate.json fixture, 1 root); retrieve-roots pins
/// retrieve (fixture L76-83: fetched with the raw
/// declarations_retrieve.json fixture, 1 root); main-roots pins main
/// (fixture L85-91: empty, 1 root).
/// Declaration build-accept, the six rejection mutations and the raw
/// fixture staging live in core-031-native-semantics.can; the production
/// process shape lives in core-031-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); the six mutations live in
/// the native-semantics file.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/WORK/PROC/N1
/// and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now. Descriptor
/// timeout 120000ms mirrors the Go 2-minute ctx (L22).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23 unmet).
/// Case native/declarations-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, question-roots, assess-roots, weights-roots,
/// arms-roots, variadic-roots, describe-roots, generate-roots,
/// retrieve-roots, main-roots.
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
